  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reflecting-content-attributes-in-idl-attributes:resulting-url-string\n\n> If the content attribute is absent, the IDL attribute must return the default value, if the content attribute has one, or else the empty string.\n\nAFAICT none of the reflecting attributes that take a URL have a default value. Was there at some point but it was removed? cc @Hixie \n",
